{"title": "HR实习生", "title_raw": "HR实习生", "location": ["上海市，北京市"], "location_raw": "上海市，北京市", "education": "", "experience": "", "salary_range": null, "salary_raw": "", "skills": [], "responsibilities": "【表现优异者有转正机会】\n1、简历筛选与流程管理： 负责技术类岗位的简历筛选、意向沟通、面试推进；\n2、人才寻访与Mapping： 参与技术方向人才Mapping，协助建立和维护技术人才库；\n3、招聘渠道运营： 维护校招招聘渠道，协助拓展人才来源渠道；\n4、校园活动支持： 协助宣讲会、Open Day 等活动的策划与执行；\n5、数据运营与流程优化： 协助统计和分析校招招聘数据，支持流程优化。", "description_html": "", "job_type": "intern", "category": "unknown", "ai_relevance": "unknown", "ai_keywords": [], "source_url": "https://job.xiaohongshu.com/campus/position?keywords=AI", "post_date": "2026-08-14", "_raw_keys": ["positionId", "positionName", "amountInNeed", "workplaceIds", "workplace", "publishTime", "recruitStatus", "duty", "qualification", "jobType", "jobProjectName", "labels"], "id": "dff65ad3e8bd7af7", "company": "小红书", "company_id": "xiaohongshu", "company_category": "big_tech", "source_platform": "browser_api", "source_type": "official", "scraped_at": "2026-08-14T10:40:27.600401+08:00"}
{"title": "【Ace顶尖实习生】大模型后训练泛化性研究", "title_raw": "【Ace顶尖实习生】大模型后训练泛化性研究", "location": ["北京市，上海市，杭州市"], "location_raw": "北京市，上海市，杭州市", "education": "", "experience": "", "salary_range": null, "salary_raw": "", "skills": [], "responsibilities": "本课题聚焦小红书通用基座模型在真实业务 OOD 场景下的泛化性问题，围绕三个方向展开：\n1）研究如何在训练阶段提升模型的 In-context Learning 与 OOD 泛化能力，包括任务抽象、数据构造、Prompt 模板改写与训练策略设计；\n2）研究如何评测这些能力，建立真实 OOD 评测和面向领域任务构造的 ICL 能力评测方法，区分真正的泛化提升与同分布收益；\n3）在模型固定的情况下，研究如何通过更好的 Context Engineering 提升模型在 OOD 任务上的表现。目标是沉淀可复用的训练、评测和 Context Engineering 方法，为小红书通用基座模型通过 Prompting 调用 API 更好服务业务提供支撑。", "description_html": "", "job_type": "intern", "category": "unknown", "ai_relevance": "unknown", "ai_keywords": [], "source_url": "https://job.xiaohongshu.com/campus/position?keywords=AI", "post_date": "2026-08-14", "_raw_keys": ["positionId", "positionName", "amountInNeed", "workplaceIds", "workplace", "publishTime", "recruitStatus", "duty", "qualification", "jobType", "jobProjectName", "labels"], "id": "498e06a4a6779553", "company": "小红书", "company_id": "xiaohongshu", "company_category": "big_tech", "source_platform": "browser_api", "source_type": "official", "scraped_at": "2026-08-14T10:40:27.696346+08:00"}
{"title": "【Ace顶尖实习生】基于Agent框架的AI搜索基座大模型", "title_raw": "【Ace顶尖实习生】基于Agent框架的AI搜索基座大模型", "location": ["北京市，杭州市，上海市"], "location_raw": "北京市，杭州市，上海市", "education": "", "experience": "", "salary_range": null, "salary_raw": "", "skills": [], "responsibilities": "传统的AI搜索依然基于RAG框架，少有的几个Agent框架也只涉及QueryPlanning，距离真实解决搜索中的实际问题还相距很远，例如做旅游攻略、做行业研究报告等等。我们判断，虽然当下LLM已经大范围的用于搜索领域，但是下一代的搜索技术变革一定是基于Agent的。本课题旨在研究基于Agent框架的基座模型。", "description_html": "", "job_type": "intern", "category": "unknown", "ai_relevance": "unknown", "ai_keywords": [], "source_url": "https://job.xiaohongshu.com/campus/position?keywords=AI", "post_date": "2026-08-14", "_raw_keys": ["positionId", "positionName", "amountInNeed", "workplaceIds", "workplace", "publishTime", "recruitStatus", "duty", "qualification", "jobType", "jobProjectName", "labels"], "id": "68ce438395531f79", "company": "小红书", "company_id": "xiaohongshu", "company_category": "big_tech", "source_platform": "browser_api", "source_type": "official", "scraped_at": "2026-08-14T10:40:27.759650+08:00"}
{"title": "【Ace顶尖实习生】向量检索在大模型场景的应用和KVCache优化研究", "title_raw": "【Ace顶尖实习生】向量检索在大模型场景的应用和KVCache优化研究", "location": ["上海市，杭州市，北京市"], "location_raw": "上海市，杭州市，北京市", "education": "", "experience": "", "salary_range": null, "salary_raw": "", "skills": [], "responsibilities": "本课题研究如何优化向量检索技术以增强AR模型和扩散语言模型（Diffusion LLM）的推理能力。主要方向包括：\n\n1、充分利用高性能网络和分布式存储设施，实现千亿级多模态数据的高效检索，结合PD分离、块扩散、并行解码、分层缓存等技术探索检索结果与大模型上下文的最优融合方法；\n2、研究基于向量检索优化大模型推理过程中的KV Cache机制，并打造业界领先的工业级大规模分布式多级KVCache推理架构，为实现小红书AI业务场景下的大规模、低成本、高性能推理提供关键技术支持。", "description_html": "", "job_type": "intern", "category": "unknown", "ai_relevance": "unknown", "ai_keywords": [], "source_url": "https://job.xiaohongshu.com/campus/position?keywords=AI", "post_date": "2026-08-14", "_raw_keys": ["positionId", "positionName", "amountInNeed", "workplaceIds", "workplace", "publishTime", "recruitStatus", "duty", "qualification", "jobType", "jobProjectName", "labels"], "id": "8f43bb5f977e8680", "company": "小红书", "company_id": "xiaohongshu", "company_category": "big_tech", "source_platform": "browser_api", "source_type": "official", "scraped_at": "2026-08-14T10:40:27.866854+08:00"}
